## 3. View 1 — Overview (`/admin`)

The KPI command center. Loads on admin login. All metrics update on page load; no auto-refresh (admin manually refreshes).

### 3.1 Top-Row KPI Cards (6 cards, responsive grid)
| Card | Metric | API Source | Format |
|---|---|---|---|
| Total Registered Users | Count of all users | `GET /api/admin/stats` | Integer |
| Verified Users | Count with `email_verified = true` | same | Integer + % of total |
| Exams Today | `exam_sessions` created in last 24h | same | Integer |
| Pass Rate (All Time) | `passed = true` / `completed` sessions | same | % |
| Active Sessions Right Now | sessions with `status = 'active'` | same | Integer (live badge) |
| Certificates Issued (All Time) | Count from `certificates` table | same | Integer |

### 3.2 Charts Section

**Chart 1 — Registrations & Exams Over Time (Line Chart)**
- X-axis: last 30 days (daily buckets)
- Y-axis: count
- Two lines: "New Registrations" (gold) + "Exams Taken" (ink/dark)
- Data from: `GET /api/admin/stats/timeseries?metric=registrations,exams&days=30`

**Chart 2 — Pass Rate by Track (Bar Chart)**
- Two grouped bars per track: Associate, Professional
- Shows: Attempts vs. Passes
- Data from: `GET /api/admin/stats/tracks`

**Chart 3 — Generation Success Rate (Donut / Pie)**
- Segments: AI Success, Buffer Fallback Used, Generation Failed + Aborted
- Data from: `GET /api/admin/stats/generation`

**Chart 4 — Average Time Per Question (Bar by Thread)**
- X-axis: Domain Threads 1–5
- Y-axis: average seconds per question in that thread
- Helps identify "too easy" or "too hard" threads
- Data from: `GET /api/admin/stats/question-timing`

### 3.3 Flag Alert Banner
- If there are **unreviewed question flags > 10**, show a yellow warning banner at the top:
  `"⚠ 14 unreviewed question flags — Review Now"` (links to `/admin/flags`)
- If there are **active high-suspicion sessions > 0**, show a red alert:
  `"🔴 2 sessions in integrity review queue"` (links to `/admin/sessions?filter=suspicious`)

