## 5. View 3 — Exam Sessions (`/admin/sessions`)

### 5.1 Layout
- Paginated table with **live-refresh toggle** (polls every 10 seconds when enabled).
- **Filters:** Status (`generating` / `active` / `completed` / `expired` / `aborted`), Track (Associate / Professional), Date range, Suspicious only (toggle).
- **Search:** by user email or session UUID.

### 5.2 Sessions Table
| Column | Data | Sortable |
|---|---|---|
| Session ID | First 8 chars of UUID + copy icon | — |
| User | Email (links to user drawer) | ✅ |
| Track | Associate / Professional badge | — |
| Status | Colored status badge | ✅ |
| Score | `score / 50` or `—` if incomplete | ✅ |
| Pass/Fail | Badge or `—` | — |
| Tab Violations | `tab_violations` count (red if > 0) | ✅ |
| Duration | `completed_at - started_at` in mm:ss | — |
| Started At | Relative time + tooltip | ✅ |
| Flags | 🚩 count if any questions flagged | — |
| Actions | [View] [Abort] (only if status = active) | — |

### 5.3 Session Detail Drawer
- **Summary:** User info, track, start/end time, score, pass/fail, IP address, user agent.
- **Integrity Signals:**
  - Tab violations count and timestamps.
  - Time per question (sparkline bar chart — flags questions answered in < 3 seconds).
  - IP + device fingerprint note.
- **Question-by-Question Table:** Q# | Domain | Correct? | Time Taken | User's Answer | Correct Answer
- **Actions:**
  - **Abort Session** (only if `status = active`) — forces session to `aborted`, sends notification email.
  - **Mark as Suspicious** — tags session for review, adds to suspicious queue.
  - **Revoke Certificate** (only if `passed = true`) — links to certificate revocation flow.

### 5.4 Suspicious Session Detection (Automatic Flagging)
The backend automatically flags a session as suspicious when:
- Perfect score (50/50) AND average time per question < 4 seconds.
- Tab violations ≥ 3.
- Session completed in under 3 minutes (180 seconds) for a 50-question exam.

These sessions appear with a 🔴 badge and are queryable via `?filter=suspicious`.

### 5.5 API — Sessions
```
GET /api/admin/sessions?page=1&limit=25&status=&track=&from=&to=&suspicious=false&search=
  Response: { data: Session[], total, page, pages }

GET /api/admin/sessions/:session_id
  Response: Full session object including questions, answers with timing

PATCH /api/admin/sessions/:session_id/abort
  Body: { reason: string }
  Response: { success: true }

PATCH /api/admin/sessions/:session_id/flag-suspicious
  Response: { success: true }
```

