## 6. View 4 — Certificates (`/admin/certificates`)

### 6.1 Layout
- Searchable, paginated table.
- **Search:** by certificate ID (`ISO27-2026-XXXXXXXX`), user email, or user name.
- **Filters:** Track, Status (Active / Revoked), Date range (awarded_on).
