## 11. UI Design Guidelines

Follows the DESIGN document but with these admin-specific overrides:

| Token | Value | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| Sidebar background | `#0A0A0A` (Ink Black) | Distinct from public portal; signals internal tool |
| Sidebar text | `#E5E5E5` | High contrast on dark |
| Active sidebar item | Gold left border (`#C9A84C`) + `#1A1A1A` bg | Matches brand accent |
| Main content area | `#FAFAFA` (off-white) | Clean data reading surface |
| Table row hover | `#F0F0F0` | Subtle feedback |
| Danger action (Revoke, Block, Delete) | `#DC2626` (red) + confirm modal required | Destructive action pattern |
| Warning action (Suspend, Flag) | `#D97706` (amber) | Caution without full danger |
| Card/stat backgrounds | White with 1px `#E5E5E5` border | Clean |
| Typography | Inter (same as portal) | Consistency |

### 11.1 Component Reuse
These components from the public portal can be reused with admin styling:
- `<Badge>` — used for status displays
- `<Dialog>` / modal — used for confirmation flows
- `<Toast>` — success/error notifications after actions
- `<Tooltip>` — used on truncated text, dates
